{"id":"018f01c4-0ffc-4c48-b970-bc9bf5f17c7c","human_readable_id":"14","title":"王安石","type":"PERSON","description":"王安石是北宋时期著名的改革家，推动了多项改革，史称“新法”。他不仅是新党的首领，积极推进各项新法，还因这些新法而遭到打压。在苏轼被贬期间，王安石曾为其求情。此外，他的改革引发了较大争议，持不同政见的人被迫离开京城。","text_unit_ids":["a6053b30c0cdc69a23d7b0e55aa2c29a4200cf69ef4b9d8515a119279de1cbdf9c38a98de07af8a0bca0cf6531047381698b37f693e765f91467c411a3accaf5","ad032814011ec3af535e738af040ecafe3572d4b86aeafb073499f4643bfb4a5b2b9034cdf3d7f16e710dc09f40ddecf3e13fbd19be29c07aa5c76aacb4edf6b","686ba4dd7e8a80c18f7e59e21bf5d4685c8016ec34e5c2e92113c036ede23de046f4a8fa07efebb741b31039934c2329b1fb5e2371f291a695777ddece3c53e5"]}
